      "text": "Nucleide `alara_parse_deck` run on `fixtures/alara/decks/sample2` and `sample3`.\nExpected values are the committed deck contents (upstream ALARA sample inputs).\nRe-parse stability re-parses the same text and requires an identical result\n(no deck serializer exists, so this is parse determinism rather than a\nwrite/read round-trip)."
    },
